 asserting a MeterRegistry bean is present and records a meter. The underlying toggle is the plain Spring Boot property spring.test.metrics.export (default false, from spring-configuration-metadata.json) — this is ordinary @SpringBootTest(properties=...) test code, not host environment/system-property setup, so it does not need a deterministic_setup entry.\",\n    \"risks\": [\n      \"This is the first 'real' artifact in the spring-boot-*-test family to be onboarded here — its sibling POM-only starters (e.g. spring-boot-starter-micrometer-metrics-test) are already marked not-for-native-image with this artifact as the replacement, but there's no prior PR in this repo for a sibling like spring-boot-webmvc-test/spring-boot-restclient-test to cross-check the exact test shape against.\"\n    ],\n    \"applied_setup\": [],\n    \"input_evidence\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"issue\",\n        \"summary\": \"#9730 Support for org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1; label=library-new-request; body_chars=39\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n        \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n    \"input_tokens_used\": 32,\n    \"output_tokens_used\": 14707\n  },\n  \"metrics\": {\n    \"input_tokens_used\": 501257,\n    \"cached_input_tokens_used\": 6648320,\n    \"output_tokens_used\": 51329,\n    \"iterations\": 12,\n    \"cost_usd\": 1.4741,\n    \"generated_loc\": 0,\n    \"tested_library_loc\": 0,\n    \"metadata_entries\": 0,\n    \"code_coverage_percent\": 0.0\n  },\n  \"artifacts\": {\n    \"metadata_file\": \"None\"\n  }\n}"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791350813481}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_6jMExOIgG56oWkVhbpHTEqh5|fc_0839edf71d674f47016ac5d81c354087d1bd0d2d2195fee980", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "> Task :tck-build-logic:extractPluginRequests UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:generatePluginAdap