ckpoint did pass 5/5 native tests, indicating that a later test variant or stale Gradle/native output introduced the failure. Metrics ended as `failure` after 12 iterations with finalization still pending and no coverage result; dynamic-access reporting also failed because its output directory was not produced.\n\nInspect:\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T05-24-36-243697Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/native-test-verify/cycle-0-finalizedTest-2026-10-07T04-53-50-525887Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-07T05-04-52-350867Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Compare checkpoint `b806c425826b829eb140e9bb9677215f475ae75f` with the later failing test variant and retain the 5-test implementation that passed native verification.\n2. Clean the coordinate’s build outputs and rerun its full test task; if `TestContextManager` remains necessary, wire Spring Test AOT generation into the test setup rather than adding unrelated hand-written metadata.\n3. Regenerate the dynamic-access coverage report and metrics after native tests pass.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0839edf71d674f47016ac5d87fb42c87d1b83b229b251a7313\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1316, "output": 1579, "cacheRead": 208256, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 211151, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791350891439, "responseId": "resp_0839edf71d674f47016ac5d86bfef487d1a9e281fb2ff9ba21", "rawStopReason": "c